l error, conditional on HLRH; structurally parallel to Thread 7 / S244 K-axis wrap with two structural weakenings (F_H ensemble-dependent, HLRH less-studied than RH+Montgomery). Cross-domain ingredient: Goldston-Montgomery 1987 bilinear-form transposed K-axis -> h-axis (USED-T already, second axis). Project's second A-shape positive-direction CONDITIONAL theorem on adjacent pi-related computation (after Thread 7), first on h-axis.
